            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. On the first day of assignment to duty in excess of twenty-four hours employees shall not be reimbursed for breakfast if such assignment commences after six A.M., for lunch if such assignment commences after twelve noon or for supper if such assignment commences after ten P.M.",
