        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "C. On the last day of assignment to duty in excess of twenty-four hours employees shall not be reimbursed for breakfast if such assignment ends before six A.M., for lunch if such assignment ends before noon or for supper if such assignment ends before six P.M.",
